# One screenshot of the finished screen

When a change is visible and you checked it in the browser, include a screenshot in the response so
the operator can see the result without opening the tool log.

- **One screenshot** of the finished screen. That is the default.
- When the change spans more than one page or component, **one screenshot per page or component**.
- Use the finished state. Leave out blank loads, failed clicks, and intermediate shots.
- Skip this when nothing on screen changed, or when you could not open the page.

These chat screenshots are separate from the E2E screenshot report the operator runs
(**end-with-targeted-make-report-verify**).
